<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
  <title>Reset Password - Sistem Magang</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@400;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet"/>
  <style>
    * {
      font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      background-color: #f5f5f5;
      padding: 20px;
    }

    .container {
      max-width: 600px;
      background-color: #ffffff;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 30px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
      text-align: center;
      color: #002942;
    }

    .logo {
      width: 180px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .heading {
      font-size: 22px;
      color: #006DA6;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }

    .content {
      font-size: 15px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .content.greeting span {
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #006DA6;
    }

    .button {
      background-color: #006DA6;
      color: #ffffff !important;
      text-decoration: none;
      padding: 12px 24px;
      border-radius: 50px;
      display: inline-block;
      font-weight: bold;
      margin: 20px 0;
    }

    .link-container {
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #002942;
      word-break: break-all;
    }

    .footer-note {
      font-size: 11px;
      color: #666;
      margin-top: 20px;
      border-top: 1px solid #eee;
      padding-top: 15px;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <img src="https://ik.imagekit.io/magangdiskominfo/Logo Simagang with Text.png" alt="Logo" class="logo" />
    <h1 class="heading">Reset Password Akun Peserta Magang</h1>
    <p class="content greeting">
      Halo <span><%= name %></span>,
    </p>
    <p class="content">
      Kami menerima permintaan untuk mengatur ulang password akun Anda. Silakan klik tombol di bawah untuk melanjutkan proses (link hanya berlaku selama 30 menit).
    </p>
    <a href="<%= resetPasswordUrl %>" class="button">Reset Password</a>
    <div class="link-container">
      Jika tombol di atas tidak bisa diklik, salin dan buka URL berikut di browser Anda:<br/>
      <a href="<%= resetPasswordUrl %>" target="_blank"><%= resetPasswordUrl %></a>
    </div>
    <p class="footer-note">
      Jika Anda tidak pernah meminta pengaturan ulang password, abaikan email ini. Kami tidak akan mengubah apapun.
    </p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
